          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="259cb497-5329-5608-b75f-b0b6164458da" name="Assault Ramp" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">In a Hull Assault may commit up to full current Crew, always keeping 1 aboard.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="1aebe0ff-75da-5d57-8029-c50263d7ed04" name="Void Marines" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Every Crew point aboard counts as Legiones Astartes (+1), free; eligible for Astartes boarding upgrades.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="43f77e74-96d5-532b-8664-18cec1866fa5" name="Hangar Loadout Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Maximum 2 aircraft squadrons: one per Hangar Bay. Assault Barge bays may carry Thunderhawks only.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="810c7ee3-a9bb-5a44-bdcf-68fd1cf3bc50" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="3cef47d1-510c-55be-9122-97c144d5d577" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      <profile id="8bc5ffed-e652-464f-a9da-75ddb14a0d49" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 2 · Starboard: 2 · Prow Assault: 2 · Defence: 3 · Hangar: 1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f7bcfa9d-81ed-42dd-a4da-c2e11c2806fb" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="bd78fb83-5535-44a0-8ae3-1d659e5cb649" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 5 · Port 2 · Starboard 2 · Prow Assault 2 · Defence 3 · Hangars 1. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
      <rules><rule id="d0e52708-b555-5a24-88dc-57d810da7c94" name="Come About!" hidden="false"><description>Escorts and Frigates may turn at any point in their move, without first running a quarter of their Speed straight.</description></rule><rule id="d714e9b8-cd38-55b6-ba76-d7135d7ba982" name="Line Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Line Ship for every rule that names one, and toward the fleet's Line minimum.</description></rule><rule id="c8d0f299-58b0-5993-9396-9be5917cd147" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="9b246e31-e52e-571f-b68d-5f1a1b2dcba8" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="83ba6c88-3cf7-5ab0-a50f-3f0198770696" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="0206ca78-ae4b-505c-81f3-ae434051cfe6" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="df5650dd-bf9e-5e28-a71a-de0292ae7f14" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="32e31f20-4379-510d-ae5b-e8d50bc1ee37" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="4cac9614-997f-5dab-87e3-f1625af30432" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="0bbaf843-f01b-5e83-b50e-a738214c39f9" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="30ae3c54-ceee-57a1-b756-510aa18e691d" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="929cad28-e893-5e93-9d5c-9c1d0c9d2a66" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="afd208cf-89db-5b7a-b7da-c98a799fc4de" name="Line Ship" hidden="false" targetId="96572996-e9b1-54a7-a2a9-2108e1dfc993" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
