            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Friendly ships within 12″ gain +2″ Speed beyond the normal ceiling and may fire Prow weapons under All Ahead Full.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
