          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="325e78f8-af80-5db8-9b41-8d5a2ea89123" name="Void Marines" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">All Crew count as Legiones Astartes (+1), free; may commit up to full current Crew in a Hull Assault, keeping 1 aboard.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="c1155e12-3530-5d06-bb74-9c6b7adb4ca6" name="Hangar Loadout Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Maximum 3 aircraft squadrons: one per Hangar Bay.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="7873bf78-9eff-521f-97c3-fd03427ea4cf" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="363cce36-852e-58db-be0f-a3bcce16f027" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      <profile id="6333c0c4-3fed-4174-b188-6f77b3ef1f03" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Weapon: 1 · Prow Assault: 4 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="17d39418-9755-4e17-81d1-9bd8a696ad06" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="473711c2-2661-408c-8d68-9e1093d8d15d" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 9 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow 1 · Prow Assault 4 · Defence 6 · Hangars 2. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
      <rules><rule id="389cf3cf-1482-5535-867b-d463acd680e4" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Lance Battery resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="a259bfd0-0d5d-518b-8aeb-657174805043" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="fbb30f15-d058-5234-9897-b4ef5d29285c" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="1a03c08d-f87c-5922-a619-87347eb72084" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="87f63bfd-b474-597e-a385-50b452c1990f" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="93ca249d-13af-569e-816e-e19bf1948ae4" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="b662d5ee-9f5d-5ed4-959f-00431993475a" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="f2d8a8b0-9e43-5b59-abc0-d21bf41db0fb" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="9e57f9d5-1a18-54a1-9e51-6ab89dc8bdb9" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="bc39f1d9-d594-5ec5-9d40-e397974d4048" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="f68ba320-5a2d-53ce-b010-4039fa9fa36f" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="9c1376d6-6cad-5d95-b791-92fef19551c4" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="49eb430d-973c-5239-9719-1e2d58da536d" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="a6923fa9-4112-4ed7-b7a7-b3207f94551f" name="Fleet Role" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="2e8a07dd-3866-4261-ad2b-669a7449407d" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="075b2901-2c2f-4879-8260-92b0f7b86314" name="Designate as Flagship" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><profiles><profile id="bd632870-dcbb-4f64-a060-31876cc17a33" name="Commander Embarkation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Choose exactly one Fleet Commander here. The Commander is embarked on this Flagship.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="3b39d861-a95d-5613-ae51-fc2b96017a02" name="Flagship" hidden="false"><description>This ship is the fleet's Flagship. Exactly one Flagship is required in a standard fleet.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="6512624c-2974-4c3c-9725-f487744cc929" name="Flagship" hidden="false" targetId="9a05d1db-3fb3-5329-a5a0-257d3cb53d11" primary="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="b20c6226-bb23-4fb2-adea-2b7e83bcf2be" name="Fleet Commander" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="103eb7fe-2818-4660-b823-77e1c0aa0d84" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="1e06fade-50d0-4666-b2bc-67251240a745" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="d392c7b1-6142-4468-ad57-67f982adec5f" name="Fleet Captain" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="bc76aa98-618f-4379-ba73-426f15d39669" type="max" />
      </constraints>
    <profiles>
        <profile id="3188bfc6-5e32-49ca-8340-df4911287161" name="Fleet Captain" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Flagship issues 2 Fleet Orders each phase. Friendly ships within 6″ gain +1 Leadership.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
